msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Is your son still in this part of town?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"He might be! His grandpa and the rest of the family are\r\n"
"looking for him now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "What's his name? Do you know what he was wearing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "His name is Subaru! I think he was wearing a white sweatshirt today!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"He got separated from the others over on Nakamichi Street,\r\n"
"so he might still be there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "All right. We'll look for him together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Thank you so much!"
